//! run
//! stdout:
//! | [1, 2, 3] [3, 2, 1] ["b", "a"]
//! since: 1.0.0
// §12 rule 4 (Lyric 5 12 Iteration): `sorted()` of a TotalOrder item and `sortedBy(cmp)`, the
// values in a list, stably.
println(f"{[3, 1, 2].iter().sorted()} {[3, 1, 2].iter().sortedBy((a, b) => b.totalCompare(a))} {["a", "b"].iter().sortedBy((a, b) => Ordering.Equal).iter().rev().toArray()}")
